WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.480
A seed phrase is 12 or 24 words.

2
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:07.339
From it the wallet derives all the keys, and from the keys the addresses.

3
00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:09.136
The arrows go only one way:

4
00:00:09.136 --> 00:00:11.665
you cannot find a key from an address.

5
00:00:11.665 --> 00:00:16.790
Whoever knows the phrase can restore the wallet anywhere and take everything.

6
00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:18.932
Hence three rules.

7
00:00:18.932 --> 00:00:20.771
The phrase cannot be changed:

8
00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:24.451
you can only create a new wallet and move the coins there.

9
00:00:24.451 --> 00:00:28.954
The phrase is never entered anywhere except to restore your own wallet:

10
00:00:28.954 --> 00:00:33.268
a request to enter it is a scam in a hundred cases out of a hundred.

11
00:00:33.268 --> 00:00:35.234
And the phrase is kept offline:

12
00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:38.406
on paper or metal, not in a photo or in the cloud.
